{
  "name": "Daily Competitor Google Ads Monitor to Slack (ClearStack Data Apify)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily Competitor Google Ads Monitor\n\n**How to set up (2 min):**\n1. Create an **HTTP Header Auth** credential: Header Name = `Authorization`, Value = `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`.\n2. Edit `targets` in the HTTP Request node (`stripe.com`, `shopify.com`, etc.) and `region` (`US`, `FR`, `GB`, `ALL`).\n3. Select your Slack channel in the last node and activate the schedule.\n\nUses `onlyNewSinceLastRun: true` so you only get alerted (and billed) for brand-new ads.\nActor docs: https://apify.com/clearstack-data/google-ads-transparency-scraper",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "setup-sticky-note",
      "name": "Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "daily-trigger",
      "name": "Every Day at 09:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/clearstack-data~google-ads-transparency-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\"targets\":[\"stripe.com\",\"shopify.com\",\"hubspot.com\"],\"region\":\"US\",\"format\":\"ALL\",\"dateRangeDays\":7,\"maxAdsPerTarget\":40,\"includeDetails\":false,\"onlyNewSinceLastRun\":true,\"monitorStateName\":\"competitors-us\"}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "call-gatc",
      "name": "Check New Competitor Google Ads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "if (!items.length) return [];\nconst lines = items.slice(0, 15).map(i => {\n  const a = i.json;\n  return `- [${a.format}] *${a.advertiserName || a.domain}* (${a.firstShownDate || 'new'}) -> ${a.adUrl}`;\n});\nreturn [{ json: { text: `*New Competitor Google Ads Detected (${items.length})*\\n` + lines.join('\\n') } }];"
      },
      "id": "format-slack",
      "name": "Format Competitor Ad Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        740,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "channel": "#competitor-ads",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}"
      },
      "id": "post-slack",
      "name": "Send Alert to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        980,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every Day at 09:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check New Competitor Google Ads",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check New Competitor Google Ads": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Competitor Ad Alert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Format Competitor Ad Alert": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Alert to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
